DESCRIPTION: \n\n\n\nOffice Hours\n\n🇪🇺 EU & EST friendly • Wee
	kly drop-in \n\nGot questions? Hit a snag? Have a wishlist?\nThis hour is 
	for you. \n\n	\n💬\n\nAsk anything about the Kit\n\n🔧\n\nGet unst
	uck on any issues you're facing\n\n📣\n\nShare feedback on what's work
	ing — and what isn't\n\n✨\n\nRequest features you'd love to see next\n
	\n	\nNo agenda\, no slides — just bring your questions and we'll dig in 
	together. \n\nSee you there! 👋\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
